        "y1": 0.7236362418743095
      },
      "text": "138. I should emphasize that by “idiosyncrasy” I mean individual variation, and not",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22588340908873314,
        "y0": 0.7254542774624295,
        "x1": 0.41000311359081393,
        "y1": 0.7362118537979896
      },
      "text": "outlier status or unusual views.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2552941266228171,
        "y0": 0.7393938170539008,
        "x1": 0.7783748900968265,
        "y1": 0.750151393389461
      },
      "text": "139. “True facts” is a memorable phrase borrowed from Hickman v. Taylor, 329 U.S.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22588206272499234,
        "y0": 0.751969428977581,
        "x1": 0.780726339302811,
        "y1": 0.7627270053131412
      },
      "text": "495, 506 (1947) (“[T]he Federal Rules of Civil Procedure are designed to enable the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22588206272499234,
        "y0": 0.7646214119111648,
        "x1": 0.7800161573621962,
        "y1": 0.775378988246725
      },
      "text": "parties to discover the true facts and to compel their disclosure whenever they may be",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2258820377923305,
        "y0": 0.7772733948447488,
        "x1": 0.2814151788848677,
        "y1": 0.788030971180309
      },
      "text": "found.”).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2552941266228171,
        "y0": 0.7911362359018037,
        "x1": 0.7779516332289752,
        "y1": 0.8018938122373639
      },
      "text": "140. See supra note 137 and accompanying text. The ambivalence is evident in Judge",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2258820377923305,
        "y0": 0.8037882188353875,
        "x1": 0.7779098211550245,
        "y1": 0.8145457951709477
      },
      "text": "Edwards’s need to sidestep the troubling aspect of such a settlement promotion strategy by",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2258820377923305,
        "y0": 0.8163638307590677,
        "x1": 0.7786240920521854,
        "y1": 0.8271214070946279
      },
      "text": "making clear he thinks it is a “false assumption” that judicial identity partially determines",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
